# 📊 Skill: GoalChain Economic Flow Visualizer

Habilidad diseñada para crear infografías artísticas y visuales que expliquen el flujo de dinero y valor dentro del ecosistema GoalChain (The Infinity Engine).

## 🛠️ Conceptos Visuales
- **Money as Light**: El flujo de $GCH debe representarse como ríos de luz verde (#14f195).
- **The Vault as a Heart**: La bóveda central debe parecer un núcleo de energía o reactor nuclear de lujo.
- **Burning as Transformation**: El quemado de tokens no debe verse destructivo, sino como energía que vuelve al ecosistema (fuego azul/púrpura).

## 💎 Infographic Prompts

### 1. THE CIRCULAR ECONOMY (The Infinity Loop)
> **Prompt**: `A high-tech circular pipeline made of glass and chrome, glowing green liquid flowing from a soccer stadium into a central massive energy core (The Vault), smaller streams of purple light coming out of the core to buy back tokens, isometric view, clean background, 3D infographic style, high-end design, minimalistic but complex --ar 16:9 --v 6.0`

### 2. THE VAULT BACKING (RWA + Staking)
> **Prompt**: `A massive bank vault door made of translucent diamond, inside you can see a futuristic soccer stadium and stacks of glowing gold bars, holographic Solana and Jito logos floating around, representing real world asset backing, cinematic lighting, ultra-safe and luxury feel --ar 16:9 --v 6.0`

### 3. YIELD GENERATION (Player Utility)
> **Prompt**: `A digital card of a soccer player connected by glowing fiber-optic cables to a massive city grid, every time the player moves the city lights up in green, representing real-time yield generation, data visualization art, futuristic, clean and powerful --ar 16:9 --v 6.0`
